 123+ 7D2C 23               inc  hl                        ; +1 (Attr Address Low)
 124+ 7D2D 23               inc  hl                        ; +2 (Attr Address High)
 125+ 7D2E 23               inc  hl                        ; +3 (Anim mask)
 126+ 7D2F 23               inc  hl                        ; +4 (Collected flag)
